    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: f81afa884c956eaac367b0ed9317e0c11e218f87 -->\n**Delta review (since 3eb606c3): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nThe only new commit is f81afa88, a merge of upstream/main 2437098f. Its one hand-resolved hunk (`git show --remerge-diff`) is in the `TOOLS` table in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`. It keeps this PR's `list_holder_library` and `set_tool_holder` rows and takes main's newer `add_tool` description (from #880, the machine default holder). Both sides are kept, nothing is dropped, and nothing else was hand-edited. The PR's own diff against main is unchanged in substance (7 files).\n\nThe author's re-gate on the merged head: app suites ok, `mcp_holder` 5/5, clippy `-p camcraft-app --lib --tests -D warnings` clean. Mergeable: yes.\n\nAs before: this is a `feat` PR, so it merges at the cut. After merging, post `PROCESS_VERSION 16` to #681.\n",
